@startuml "Command - Air Conditioner - Class Diagram"
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members
title A switch with four buttons

class Person <<Client>> {
  + action()
}
class ACSwitch <<Invoker>> {
  - turnOnCommand : Command
  - turnOffCommand : Command
  - turnOnHeaterCommand : Command
  - turnOnCoolerCommand : Command
  + turnOn(int)
  + turnOff()
  + turnOnHeater(int)
  + turnOnCooler(int)
}
interface Command {
  + execute()
  + undo()
  + redo()
}
class TurnOnCommand
class TurnOffCommand
class HeatCommand
class CoolCommand
class AirConditioner <<Receiver>> {
  + turnOn(Temperature)
  + turnOff()
  + turnOnHeater(Temperature)
  + turnOnCooler(Temperature)
}

Command <|.. TurnOnCommand
Command <|.. TurnOffCommand
Command <|.. HeatCommand
Command <|.. CoolCommand

note right of Command
  undo() and redo() are declared and
  not yet implemented: each command
  holds only the air conditioner, not
  the temperature it replaced.
end note
Person --> ACSwitch
ACSwitch ..> Command : creates and runs
TurnOnCommand --> AirConditioner
TurnOffCommand --> AirConditioner
HeatCommand --> AirConditioner
CoolCommand --> AirConditioner
@enduml
